                    <p class="edu-meta">University of Tehran · 2024 – 2026 · GPA: 19.42/20</p>
                    <p><strong>Thesis:</strong> <em>&ldquo;AI Adoption in Quality of Banking Services: A Capability–Attractiveness Assessment&rdquo;</em> — applied BWM and TOPSIS to evaluate and rank AI applications for banking service quality using expert panel data. (Supervisor: Dr. Rohollah Ghasemi).</p>
                </div>
